# Only what is listed here is published: the server, the tools, the notes and the model viewer page.
# Everything else in this folder stays local: the client and its static files (tanki-src/), game resources
# (tanki-assets/), traffic captures with account data (captures/), the browser profile, the server cache (cache/).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/MODLOG.md
!/requirements.txt
!/server/
!/server-notes/
!/tools/
!/tanki-viewer/
/tanki-viewer/*
!/tanki-viewer/index.html

# accounts of the local server
/server/data/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.part
